.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vs/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Human task register (guardrail G2) - rewritten every round, so tracking it
# churns git status continuously. Deliberately NOT tracked: committed once at
# 4620947 as a historical snapshot, then untracked via `git rm --cached` so this
# entry actually takes effect (.gitignore governs untracked files only).
#
# The file still exists on disk at docs/HUMAN_TASKS.md and is still maintained
# every round - it is the live register of what needs a human. It is simply not
# in the repo. If you cloned this and the file is missing, that is why: ask for
# it, or read the 4620947 snapshot for the shape. See ACTION_PLAN section 18.6.
docs/HUMAN_TASKS.md
